# (multi-user access model) plus 77 (user drives on Docker, capabilities) less 18 (renamed settings, upgrades,
# Kubernetes day-2, high availability). The growth is cell-expansion headings and their summary cells, less the
# joiners turned into full stops, so growth fails.
